    "Paper (Tabla 1): Swin-T 28M / 4.5G, Swin-S 50M / 8.7G, Swin-B 88M / 15.4G, Swin-B@384 88M / 47.0G. Esos 'FLOPs' del paper son MACs (convención fvcore): FlopCounterMode da 2 × MACs.",
